  "changelog": "alibabacloud-migration-mas-product-mapping v0.0.1 \u2013 initial release.\n\n- Provides cross-vendor cloud product mapping for AWS, Tencent Cloud, Huawei Cloud, and Azure to Alibaba Cloud.\n- Supports name and instance spec mapping, usage conversion, and real-time Alibaba Cloud pricing.\n- Accepts input as plain text, JSON, or Excel/CSV cloud bills and auto-detects vendor.\n- Enforces confirmation of source vendor and target Alibaba Cloud region before pricing.\n- Pricing service uses Alibaba Cloud's default credential chain; hardcoded credentials are forbidden.\n- Outputs vendor-to-product mapping in markdown table, includes fallback and normalization for unavailable specs.",
